.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt MESA-OVERLAY-CONTROL.PY 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mesa-overlay-control.py
.Nd control the Mesa Vulkan overlay
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
controls Mesa's Vulkan overlay through its control socket.
The overlay is part of the selected Mesa Vulkan driver.
Its configuration is independent of the compositor's renderer.
